<p>Aajaaiye baaba mere aajaiye baaba<br />
Noha ye sakina ka tha aajaiye baaba</p>

<p>1. Is qaid se aakar humein chudhwaaiye baba<br />
Aajaiye baba mere aajaiye baba</p>

<p>2. Ab tab nahi mujhme zaalim ke tamacho ki<br />
Kab tak mai mazaalim sahu batlaiye baba</p>

<p>3. Zaalim ne rasan baandhi gale me mere kas kar<br />
Dam rukta hai aakar use khulwaaiye baba</p>

<p>4. Mare na tamaache mujhe seli na lagaaye<br />
Aap aake zara shimr ko samjhaiye baba</p>

<p>5. Hai sar khule phupi meri ghairo ke saamne<br />
Chaadar phupi ke waste le aaiye baba</p>

<p>6. Soti thi sada aapke seene pe sakina<br />
Kis tarha soou&rsquo;n khaak pe farmaaiye baba</p>

<p>7. Baba ye nouha mir ka kar lijiye qubool<br />
Rouze pe apne usko bhi bulwaaiye baba</p>

